      "problem_text": "Expand (1+x)^3(1-2x)^2 up to x^3.",
      "answer": "1 - x - 5x^2 + 3x^3",
      "solution": "(1+x)^3=1+3x+3x^2+x^3. (1-2x)^2=1-4x+4x^2. Multiply: constant=1. x: 1(-4x)+3x(1)=-4+3=-x. x^2: 1(4x^2)+3x(-4x)+3x^2(1)=4-12+3=-5x^2. x^3: 1(0)+3x(4x^2)+3x^2(-4x)+x^3(1)=12x^3-12x^3+x^3=x^3. Result: 1-x-5x^2+x^3",
